{"id":"u-44133756-ed03-460f-be29-f8e7a45cfe4c","src":"community","title":"Ultimate Workout","author":"Umair Ahmad","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Y4Imsw-november-workout","desc":"Welcome to my 12-Week Fitness Journey!\n\nThis programme is designed to build an aesthetic, strong and balanced physique through consistent training, progressive overload and discipline.\n\nMAIN GOALS\n\n* Build lean muscle and overall strength.\n* Develop a well-defined chest, back, shoulders and arms.\n* Strengthen legs and improve body balance.\n* Develop stronger abdominal muscles and core stability.\n* Improve cardiovascular fitness and stamina.\n* Reduce overall body fat while preserving muscle.\n\nWEEKLY TRAINING SPLIT\n\nDay 1 – Chest + Triceps\nDay 2 – Back + Biceps\nDay 3 – Shoulders + Legs\nDay 4 – Active Recovery\nDay 5 – Chest + Triceps\nDay 6 – Back + Biceps\nDay 7 – Optional \n\nAbs, core and treadmill cardio are included throughout the programme.\n\nTRAINING PRINCIPLES\n\n* Focus on correct exercise technique.\n* Increase weights gradually as strength improves.\n* Maintain consistency and track every workout.\n* Prioritise nutrition, hydration and recovery.\n* Progress at your own pace.\n\nMY MINDSET\n\nDiscipline over motivation. Consistency over perfection. Progress over excuses.\n\n12 weeks of commitment. One stronger version of myself.\n\nLET’S GET TO WORK!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Bodyweight Fitness","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-01T17:52:19.839Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest + Triceps A + Abs","Back + Biceps A + Core","Shoulders + Legs A","Rest","Chest + Triceps B + Abs","Back + Biceps B + Core","Shoulders + Legs B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":480}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n